WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.667
The driver's runs: deliveries and containers.

00:00:04.367 --> 00:00:09.633
My runs. Deliveries, container drops, pickups and swaps, today first.

00:00:10.133 --> 00:00:14.900
The run. When, the load, the container and the truck, with Directions.

00:00:15.400 --> 00:00:18.767
On my way. The office sees you are on the road.

00:00:19.267 --> 00:00:21.600
A photo. Where you left it.

00:00:22.100 --> 00:00:27.767
Mark it done. Pick the container that went out if it asks, add a note, and mark it done.

00:00:28.267 --> 00:00:33.233
That's it. The crew app speaks Spanish too, when the phone app is set to Spanish.
